      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each booking references one business, service, professional and customer.\n\n*Each identity links to 0..1 customer. The unique index permits at most one\nidentity per business + bot + customer; a customer can link across bots.\n\nreminder_inbox is a demo sink. idempotency_records.resource_id is a logical\nbooking link, NOT a declared FK.",
      "originalText": "Each booking references one business, service, professional and customer.\n\n*Each identity links to 0..1 customer. The unique index permits at most one\nidentity per business + bot + customer; a customer can link across bots.\n\nreminder_inbox is a demo sink. idempotency_records.resource_id is a logical\nbooking link, NOT a declared FK.",
