      "updated": 1794484800000,
      "created": 1794484800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Removing unused audit_events and, after webhook cutover, polling offsets takes 15 tables to 13. Replacing reminder_inbox with a real outbox keeps the count at 13. New\ndurable leases, commands or tenant configuration may add tables again. Optimize responsibilities and correctness, not an arbitrary table target.",
      "originalText": "Removing unused audit_events and, after webhook cutover, polling offsets takes 15 tables to 13. Replacing reminder_inbox with a real outbox keeps the count at 13. New\ndurable leases, commands or tenant configuration may add tables again. Optimize responsibilities and correctness, not an arbitrary table target.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
