      "text": "app/telegram_worker.py: run(), _process_pending_updates();\ntelegram_repository.py: acquire_worker_lock().\n\nAdding replicas fails the bot lock; slow audio/model work delays everyone.\nSplit roles and serialize only per conversation.",
