    },
    {
      "id": "capy-0410",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 13798.000000000002,
      "width": 1062,
      "height": 257.40000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#253047",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "capy-0408-group"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 728570,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 127510,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794484800000,
      "created": 1794484800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Measure traffic, model latency, DB queries/locks and per-bot delivery.\n2. Harden tenant constraints and retry tests.\n3. Add durable webhook ingestion and per-conversation ownership.\n4. Separate senders; remove global reply blocking.\n5. Add bounded concurrency, pooling and safe crash recovery.\n6. Implement real reminders, TTS and approved FAQ content.\n7. Load-test 1, 5, 20 and 100 turns/s; tune autoscaling.\n8. Remove obsolete tables only with data/consumer checks and forward\nmigrations.",
      "originalText": "1. Measure traffic, model latency, DB queries/locks and per-bot delivery.\n2. Harden tenant constraints and retry tests.\n3. Add durable webhook ingestion and per-conversation ownership.\n4. Separate senders; remove global reply blocking.\n5. Add bounded concurrency, pooling and safe crash recovery.\n6. Implement real reminders, TTS and approved FAQ content.\n7. Load-test 1, 5, 20 and 100 turns/s; tune autoscaling.\n8. Remove obsolete tables only with data/consumer checks and forward\nmigrations.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 22
    },
