      "text": "Source review: migrations 0001-0003; app/booking.py; app/scheduling.py; app/repositories.py; app/database.py; app/telegram_worker.py; app/channels/telegram_repository.py;\napp/graph/redis_checkpoint.py; app/reminders.py; docker-compose.yml. Related design: docs/system-design-100k.md. No live database or production load was inspected.",
